meta {
  name: 2. Check payment status
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{telrGatewayUrl}}
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "method": "check",
    "store": "{{telrStoreId}}",
    "authkey": "{{telrAuthKey}}",
    "order": {
      "ref": "{{telrOrderReference}}"
    }
  }
}

docs {
Checks the payment outcome for the Telr order reference saved by **1. Create payment session**. In production, perform this verification on your backend after the customer returns from Telr (and whenever your webhook/return handler needs confirmation). Only update the matching Rose booking/order after validating the returned status and reference.
}
